    "detailed_description": "<h1>WARNING!</h1><p>This game does not promote animal cruelty, it is just a joke. We encourage all of you to treat animals with warmth and love. All animals are beautiful, it is hard to imagine our life without them.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're just an ordinary guy from an ordinary family. Yesterday was your birthday, and guess what? Your friends gave you a whole box of dildos as a gift! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What should you do with them now? Throw them away in the trash or find a more useful purpose for them? Start playing and make YOUR CHOICE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151930/extras/6f0f2ae94e4531ab9b0828cf96fc76c0.poster.avif?t=1751638769\" width=616 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151930/extras/6f0f2ae94e4531ab9b0828cf96fc76c0.webm?t=1751638769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151930/extras/6f0f2ae94e4531ab9b0828cf96fc76c0.mp4?t=1751638769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An absolutely genius game... That nobody asked for, but it exists anyway!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unforgettable gameplay! Today is your chance to master the art of throwing dildos exactly!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Few endings, because it's up to you what becomes of the whole box of dildos. But remember, letting hate have its consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Light-hearted humor and the opportunity to spend some leisurely time with a smile on your face.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > No more thinking about what game to get your friend for his birthday. Here it is, the perfect gift!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > BANANA MODE - if you want to easily showcase the game on YouTube, Twitch, or any other platform.</p></li></ul>",
